# 後ろ向きの動的計画法（右から数えて、自分より大きい値が来るまでの長さ —— 二つの場が降りる軸をまたぐ）
table a = (0,3),(1,1),(2,4),(3,1),(4,5),(5,9),(6,2),(7,6)
field v : flat bound 8
v[i] <- x   for (i,x) in a
field big : or bound 9 10
field run : max bound 9
run[8] <- 0
big[n, k] <- true   for (n) in 0 .. 7 for (k) in 0 .. 9 if v[n] > k
run[n] <- run[n + 1] + 1   for (n) in 0 .. 7 if not big[n + 1, 5]
run[n] <- 0   for (n) in 0 .. 7 if big[n + 1, 5]
print run
